    SEAT -->|"[ei]"| WAIT --> VIEW

    ACTIVE -->|"[ei]"| ERR --> ENDERR
    OPEN -->|"[ei]"| ERR
    DEADLINE -->|"[ei]"| ERR
    DUP -->|"[ei]"| ERR

    CANCEL --> CANCEL_ROUTE --> CANCEL_FN --> WAS_CONF
    WAS_CONF -->|"[jah]"| QUEUE
    WAS_CONF -->|"[ei, ootejarjekorra rida]"| VIEW
